      func-mem-documentation = <<_EnD_oF_dEf_TeXt_
@iverbatim 
   Supports decimal and hexadecimal (prefix "0x" or "0X") formats.
@endiverbatim\ilinebr 
@param value Pointer to the double to store the result.
