   (Not thread-safe in preemptive multitasking environments.)
@endiverbatim\ilinebr 
@param mutex Pointer to the mutex handler structure.
@return      MUTEX_ERROR_OK on success, MUTEX_ERROR_PARM if pointer is NULL.
_EnD_oF_dEf_TeXt_;
